{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"99866","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/99866","key":"MC-249513","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"25/Mar/22 1:42 PM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<h3><a name=\"Thebug\"></a>The bug</h3>\n<p>Frogspawn is not next to the turtle egg in the Creative inventory, despite both of them being mob egg blocks.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Howtoreproduce\"></a>How to reproduce</h3>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Be in Creative</li>\n\t<li>Look through the \"Miscellaneous\" tab</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<h3><a name=\"Expectedresults\"></a>Expected results</h3>\n<p>The turtle egg and frogspawn would be next to each other.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Actualresults\"></a>Actual results</h3>\n<p>The turtle egg is one slot away from being as far away from frogspawn as physically and mathematically possible.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Howtofix\"></a>How to fix</h3>\n<p>Frogspawn should be moved to be directly after the turtle egg in the Miscellaneous tab.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Furthernotes\"></a>Further notes</h3>\n<p>In addition to moving frogspawn next to the turtle egg, it may also be worth moving the chicken egg to just before it, as while it's not a block that hatches over time, it's still an egg, and would make more sense to be there.</p>\n\n<p>In addition, the conduit should probably be moved to be directly next to the beacon as both are area-of-effect buff blocks; I figured it'd make sense to mention this here since the turtle egg is currently directly between both of them.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"26/Mar/22 2:21 AM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/131046","id":"131046","filename":"